      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:3igkkqe5nkm66olc4y2syzpy/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2pmq2myy22r",
      "handle": "markriedl.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Mark Riedl",
      "text": "Even without this technique, one could fine-tune an LLM one way or another. People can make software do whatever they want. Including bad people. There is no magic software that cannot be made to do bad things by bad people. AI is just software wrapped in anthropomorphism.",
